  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 8.8% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $3.18B (8.8% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2026-10-08-securitize-launches-tokenized-us-stocks-solana-418043\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Securitize launches 1:1-backed tokenized stocks, starting with Apple, Nvidia, Strategy and more</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/380458/securitize-nvidia-apple-amazon-tokenized-stocks-solana\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Securitize Brings Nvidia, Apple and Amazon Onchain With Tokenized Stocks on Solana</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/securitize-stock-jumps-launching-tokenized-us-equities-solana?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Securitize stock jumps over 10% after launching tokenized US equities on Solana</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/08/securitize-brings-apple-nvidia-and-tesla-to-solana-with-nyse-trading-in-the-works\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Securitize brings Apple, Nvidia and Tesla to Solana, with NYSE trading in the works</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
